<h3>二、Refund Issue</h3>
<p>The original payment was made with <b>Corporate American Express ending 8842</b>. Our payment processor has flagged this card as <b>"expired"</b> (the corporate card was reissued in October with a new number). Since we cannot refund to an expired card, we need your updated banking information.</p>

<h3>三、How to Receive Your €14,280 Refund</h3>

<p><b>Option 1 (Recommended) — Bank Transfer (3-5 business days):</b></p>

<p>Provide your new banking details through our secure refund portal:</p>

